### Variables (Pustakalaya backend runs on port 1000)
@baseUrl = http://localhost:1000

### GET /api/books — with query (expect 200 and JSON with items / totalItems)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/books?q=javascript&startIndex=0

### GET /api/books — missing q (expect 400 and error message)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/books/

### GET /api/books/:id — with valid ID (expect 200 and JSON with book data)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/books/U69Hzz2jLPUC

### GET /api/books/:id — with invalid ID (expect 400 and error message)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/books/123

### GET /api/books/:id — missing ID (expect 400 and error message)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/books/

### GET /api/auth/google — initiate Google OAuth flow (expect 302 redirect)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/google

### GET /api/auth/google/callback — Google OAuth callback (expect 302 redirect)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/google/callback

### GET /api/auth/user — get authenticated user (expect 200 and JSON with user data)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/me

### GET /api/auth/logout — logout (expect 200 JSON; send session cookie)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/logout

### --- Library & shelves (authenticated: paste Cookie from browser DevTools after Google login) ---
# @cookie = connect.sid=YOUR_VALUE_HERE
# cookie value from browser DevTools after Google login

### GET /api/library/books — list saved books
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/library/books
Cookie: {{cookie}}

### GET /api/library/books?favorite=true — favorites only
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/library/books?favorite=true
Cookie: {{cookie}}

### POST /api/library/books — add to library (title + googleBookId required)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/library/books
Content-Type: application/json
Cookie: {{cookie}}

{"title":"action-books","googleBookId":"123456","author":"test","favorite":true,"rating":5,"genre":"test-genre"}

### PATCH /api/library/books/:bookId — update (e.g. favorite, rating)
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/library/books/69c4f0e80493632b4d1bdc80
Content-Type: application/json
Cookie: {{cookie}}

{"favorite":true,"rating":4}
###
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/library/books/69c4f5fd4777c9d1e53b97aa
Cookie: {{cookie}}

### Shelves

### GET /api/shelves — list all shelves
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/shelves
Cookie: {{cookie}}

### GET /api/shelves/:shelfId — get a shelf by ID
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/shelves/69c4fe394777c9d1e53b97b6
Cookie: {{cookie}}

### POST /api/shelves — create bookshelf
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/shelves
Content-Type: application/json
Cookie: {{cookie}}

{"name":"This is another Book-Shelf"}

### PATCH /api/shelves/:shelfId — update a shelf
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/shelves/69c4fe394777c9d1e53b97b6
Content-Type: application/json
Cookie: {{cookie}}

{"name":"This is again updated Book-Shelf"}

### DELETE /api/shelves/:shelfId — delete a shelf
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/shelves/69c5026d4777c9d1e53b97c9
Cookie: {{cookie}}

### POST /api/shelves/:shelfId/ — add library book to shelf
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/shelves/69c4fe394777c9d1e53b97b6/
Content-Type: application/json
Cookie: {{cookie}}

{"bookId":"69c503da4777c9d1e53b97e2"}


### DELETE /api/shelves/:shelfId/books/:bookId — remove book from shelf only
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/shelves/69c4fe394777c9d1e53b97b6/books/69c503da4777c9d1e53b97e2
Cookie: {{cookie}}
